  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the capacity of the Colombian health sector and access to health services for migrants in the context of COVID-19</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This LAIF project seeks to improve health outcomes of migrants and hosts communities through increasing health insurance coverage and providing better access to basic health services for vulnerable irregular migrants, with special attention on women and their sexual and reproductive rights, girls, boys and adolescents, victims of gender violence and mental health.</narrative>
  </description>
